    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d294">

                <pb facs="0292" n="285" xml:id="pg285"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9015: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-07-28T16:00:00+09:00">July 28, 1937—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received July 28—8:45 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>229. 1. A telegram reporting the result of my call on the Minister for Foreign
                        Affairs<anchor n="97" xml:id="d294-f1"/> in compliance with Department’s
                    128, July 27, 1 p.m.,<anchor n="98" xml:id="d294-f2"/> will follow
                        shortly.<anchor n="99" xml:id="d294-f3"/></p>
                <p>2. The Vice Minister for Foreign Affairs has just called me up on the telephone
                    and at Hirota’s request has read to me the substance of a report just received
                    from the commander of the Japanese forces in North China to the following
                    effect:</p>
                <p>A Japanese officer called this morning on the Mayor of Peiping and stated that
                    complete withdrawal of Chinese troops from the walled city would not be required
                    by noon today but that such withdrawal would be expected to begin and to be
                    completed “in due course;” measures are being taken to safeguard the interests
                    in Peiping of other foreign powers. The statement added that the Japanese troops
                    within the walls of Peiping would not attack unless challenged.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Nanking.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
